  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a57cf1c7-156f-435b-8550-5840447b0398-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 185px;\" /></p><p>When the pseudo force acting on the person is in opposite direction to the weight then the person will experience weight loss. The direction of the pseudo force is opposite to the direction of the frame of reference.</p><p>Hence, B&nbsp;is the correct answer.</p>",
